    56	**1** **INTRODUCTION**
    57	
    58	
    59	Automated software tests are a corner-stone of software quality
    60	assurance, as they form the basis for efficient regression testing, safe
    61	refactoring, and test-driven development. However, by automating
    62	software tests, they have entered the realm of software themselves
    63	and have become prone to the same problems that the code under
